<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa Ozz rises on back of good results.</title>
<headline>S.Africa Ozz rises on back of good results.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African investment holding firm Ozz Ltd jumped on Tuesday as the market digested a strong set of year results.</p>
<p>The group's share was up 90 cents to 27.30 rand by 0910 GMT.</p>
<p>The firm, which posted the figures during Monday's market holiday, saw headline earnings per share jump to 202.3 cents from 168.0 cents last time. Its dividend rose to 72.5 cents from 60.0 cents.</p>
<p>&quot;They are a good set of results, especially as they were coming off a high base from last time,&quot; one dealer said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
